window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>For years I’ve dreamt of my own death. Not any details, just the feel of an explosion, of sparks and smoke blasting into my face. Pain and the sensation of falling.</p> <p>Love feels like that. Maybe not for everyone, but to me, it feels like dying.</p> <p>As I face my death, I hold onto that. My life may be bookended by pain and tragedy but there was a moment when I was loved and I loved in return.</p> <p>In the end, nothing else matters.</p> <p><i>Darkest Before Dawn is a dark romance with intense, sensual themes. It is book 2 in the His Perfect Darkness duet and the resolution of Rex and Inara's story.</i></p>"; 
